Hi Clayton,

Thanks for your response! You're right that my trap coordinate projection and shapefile projection didn't match, however changing this hasn't changed the error that I get. The make.mask function does seem to run in the sense that it creates the mask, but there's only empty space where there should be x and y variables.

In regards to your suggestion to remove the 'non-habitat' sections of the polygon. I'm not considering this to be non-habitat, as I believe that possums are capable of inhabiting these landscapes as well, hence why I've left the polygons in.

Cheers for your suggestions,

Charlotte

